{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大溫哥華史丹利公園（Stanley Park）即日起至12月31日舉行沉浸式燈光展「星光幻境」（Astra Lumina）【詳情】，展覽設有9大主題區域，融合燈光、投影和音效，在被樹木包圍下，為遊客帶來沉浸式夜遊體驗，猶如置身夢幻國度。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.397702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:13:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:10.617647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.860610+00:00","content_hash":"00d22ce39e96fe86334b65a161a8a7dc74109555809eb06bb363ce1be4fd63e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}